instrument wingie
; voice loops — your own voice into the Wingie's microphones, onto tape, into the cistern
; Mode 1 (held) punches into the tape loop; Mode 2 (held) freezes the spectrum
; fader1 Mix: how worn the tape is; fader2 Decay: how long the cistern keeps it; fader3 Volume

2026-11-24
----------
; six seconds of tape, two heads; what falls off it sings on in the cistern
the tape is tapeloop seconds=6 gap=0.37
the cistern is eis rate=0.2 depth=0.5
the breath is specfreeze blend=0.1
the level is vca

mic.both -> tape
mode1 -> tape.punch
fader1 -> tape.age
tape.left -> cistern
fader2 -> cistern.feedback
mic.both -> breath
mode2 -> breath.freeze
tape.left breath -> left
tape.right breath -> right
cistern.left -40> left
cistern.right -40> right

Deep listening
--------------
; a long room that only listens: hold Mode 2 and it rings on with nothing new let in
the cave is cavern size=0.8 dark=0.6
the wide is haas width=0.7
mic.both -> cave
mode2 -> cave.hold
fader2 -> cave.size
cave.left -> wide
wide.left -> left
wide.right -> right
cave.right -50> right
